{"version":1,"content":"<p>職業訓練局（VTC）今（3日）宣布，下學年（2027/28）起將增加整體學額超過一成，共逾1.4萬個。</p><p>VTC高級助理執行幹事（教務）郭龍基稱，有關調整是考慮過目前社會發展路徑及市場需要，而工程、航空物流、盛事經濟及健康護理是本港重要產業，校方預料新增的學額或聚焦上述範疇。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:42:48.299709+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:13:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.875642+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:38:53.237300+00:00","content_hash":"d3fd5f2b76b63b61ebc66b63b09b26cfc0d34c2a7213b4d8c1e393a10c88c8da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}